OL,3,GNEWSAEMR told to improve ahead of
OL,4,Arenationalisation
OL,5,
OL,6,FEast Midlands Railway (EMR) has been
OL,7,Ftold by the government it needs to take
OL,8,F"immediate action" to improve its
OL,9,Fperformance before the service is
OL,10,Frenationalised.
OL,12,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) said
OL,13,Fit was expecting the rail operator to
OL,14,Ftransfer into public ownership by the
OL,15,Fend of 2027, as part of its plans to
OL,16,Ftake control of nearly all rail
OL,17,Fservices in England.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
