OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAEMR told to improve ahead of
OL,4,Arenationalisation
OL,5,
OL,6,FProblems with EMR's new Aurora (Class
OL,7,F810) fleet led to months of delays,
OL,8,Fcancellations and overcrowding on
OL,9,Fservices, as well as strike action by
OL,10,FRMT union members.
OL,12,FThe government has said the operator
OL,13,Fneeds to do everything it can to
OL,14,Fresolve the issues as quickly as
OL,15,Fpossible, to give passengers a "more
OL,16,Freliable" service.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
